  "metadata": {
    "title": "Stereo Delay",
    "description": "Two feedback delay lines, the right one Spread times longer than the left, with a low-pass Tone on the echoes and a dry/wet Mix. With Sync to tempo on, Time is the delay at 120 BPM and scales with the tempo (the project's, or the host's in a plugin), so a dotted eighth stays one. Mono input on channel 1, stereo output."
